# Direct Python dependencies for the isolated Docling lab (docs/rag-improvement/README.md §B3).
# Regenerate the hashed lock after changing this file:
#   npm run generate:docling-lab-lock        (requires Python 3.11 — the lab image interpreter)
#
# The CPU-only torch index keeps multi-GB CUDA wheels out of the sandbox image; the
# lab benchmarks extraction on CPU exactly as the worker would run it.
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu

